  "prefLabel": "Ins 2604.02 Applicability and Scope",
  "priorExpiration": "2007-04-01",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 2604.02 Applicability and Scope. This part shall apply to life, accident or health insurance policies that are not regulated under Ins 2601, Ins 2602, or Ins 2603 and to any entity which holds a license to sell, issue or administer these policies in this state.\n\nSource. #6971, eff 4-1-99, EXPIRED: 4-1-07\n\nNew. #9333, eff 12-5-08; ss by #11173, eff 12-5-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins2600.html"
